  ],
  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {損害|そんがい}{賠償|ばいしょう} - compensation for damages\n- {賠償金|ばいしょうきん} - compensation money, indemnity\n- {賠償|ばいしょう}{請求|せいきゅう} - claim for damages\n- {賠償|ばいしょう}{責任|せきにん} - liability for damages\n- {戦争|せんそう}{賠償|ばいしょう} - war reparations\n\nLEGAL CONTEXT:\nCommonly used in legal documents and news about lawsuits.\n- {損害|そんがい}{賠償|ばいしょう}{訴訟|そしょう} - lawsuit for damages\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {補償|ほしょう} - compensation (general)\n- {弁償|べんしょう} - reimbursement, making amends",
